{
 "title": "常量",
 "blocks": [
  {
   "t": "p",
   "text": "`const` 在文件级别（函数外部）定义一个编译期已知的值。你可以写出它的类型，也可以交给编译器。它们的名字通常用大写字母书写。"
  },
  {
   "t": "code",
   "code": [
    "const MAX_SCORE: i32 = 100",
    "const APP_NAME = \"Notebook\"",
    "",
    "fn main():",
    "    print(APP_NAME, MAX_SCORE)"
   ],
   "run": true,
   "output": [
    "Notebook 100"
   ]
  },
  {
   "t": "p",
   "text": "常量让你不必在许多函数里重复同一个数字；值变了，只需改一个地方。"
  },
  {
   "t": "code",
   "code": [
    "const PI: f64 = 3.14159",
    "",
    "fn circle_area(r: f64) -> f64:",
    "    return PI * r * r",
    "",
    "fn main():",
    "    print(circle_area(2.0))"
   ],
   "run": true,
   "output": [
    "12.56636"
   ]
  },
  {
   "t": "exercise",
   "id": "c01-l06-x1",
   "prompt": "定义常量 `TAX_RATE` 等于 18。价格为 200 时，输出 `price * TAX_RATE / 100`。",
   "starter": [
    "fn main():",
    "    price = 200",
    "    print(0)"
   ],
   "solution": [
    "const TAX_RATE = 18",
    "",
    "fn main():",
    "    price = 200",
    "    print(price * TAX_RATE / 100)"
   ],
   "hint": "把 `const TAX_RATE = 18` 这一行写在 `main` 上面。",
   "expected": [
    "36"
   ]
  },
  {
   "t": "quiz",
   "id": "c01-l06-q1",
   "q": "`const` 在哪里定义？",
   "options": [
    "只能在 `main` 里面",
    "在文件级别，函数外部",
    "在圆括号里"
   ],
   "answer": 1,
   "why": "`const` 在文件级别；函数内部使用 `fixed`。"
  }
 ]
}
